[JUMP FLIP-FLOP
[IF SET, WILL RETURN AT p+2
[IF RESET, WILL RETURN AT p+1
[
[TO SET, JMP 8J-3
[TO RESET, JMP 8J-7
[TO UTILIZE, JMP 8J
[ENTRY AT 8J
[CALL: JMP 8J
[      <RESET DISPATCH>
[      <SET DISPATCH>
[
[RESET
LDA i
NOP
STC p+5
JMP 0
[SET
LDA i
XSK i 0
STC p+1
[FLIP-FLOP
#8J <FF INSTR>
JMP 0
